  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "tx2729",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 500,
   "width": 1240,
   "height": 35.0,
   "text": "Every option gets a probability — you see the runner-up (auth .14), not just the winner. The verdict is the argmax option plus its calibrated\nconfidence, so a low-confidence route can be gated to a human instead of acted on blindly.",
   "originalText": "Every option gets a probability — you see the runner-up (auth .14), not just the winner. The verdict is the argmax option plus its calibrated\nconfidence, so a low-confidence route can be gated to a human instead of acted on blindly.",
